        "text_0XsfiWRFV3SIG1lu": "<p><strong>How To Use Lio? </strong></p>",
        "text_1Z9aVxzXlefR4wgb": "<p><strong>Using Your Lio Is Simple—Just 3 Steps</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Fray</strong> your preferred flavour core.</p></li><li><p><strong>Slide</strong> the core into the Lio.</p></li><li><p><strong>Relief</strong> your cravings and stress with every breath.</p></li></ol>",
        "text_r1PLpWlv2kEu0HYn": "<p><strong>Shipping &amp; Refunds</strong></p>",
