        "text_OR9pCsH2IRYTOj0q": "<p><strong>What’s Included?</strong></p>",
        "text_YIXSDfJQidyg4FAR": "<p><strong>The Journey Pack has everything you need: </strong></p><p></p><ul><li><p><strong>Lio Diffuser</strong>: Handcrafted in olive or walnut wood.</p></li><li><p><strong>6 Flavour Core Bags</strong>: Lasts 60 days for natural relief.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lio Carry Case</strong>: Portable and stylish for on-the-go use.</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Quit Together with the Lio Together Pack</strong> Includes 2 Lio diffusers, 12 flavour core bags, and 2 carry cases—perfect for you and a partner. Double the support for better results!</p>",
        "text_VTTi0jieYfEGfyQd": "<p><strong>Safe &amp; Secure Payments</strong></p>",
