        "text_W0VNev2oT8d41nxt": "<p>Verified </p>",
        "text_zG4zgfJ4vXVw0mN7": "<p>— Nour Al-Din</p>",
        "text_thbX9zNpQyTgsBav": "<p>\"I'm positively surprised by this. I haven't craved my bad habit for the past two weeks.\"</p><p></p>",
