        "text_utGPTd7MDSVvhhTB": "<p>Verified </p>",
        "text_aaC4FJv1vUT8x1cN": "<p>— James Walker</p>",
        "url_mInW4DSAY3ZvPeCk": "#iQOzOcy59IDcgCklf",
        "text_6MNOztJjMJGmiWHa": "<p>Order Journey Pack</p>",
        "text_kGFyIOkloja2wmLe": "<p>30-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "text_MsrFrzSU7SpnxaZT": "<h3><strong>YOU ASKED</strong></h3>",
        "text_BIpXqZLKs2JiAA8j": "<h3><strong>WE ANSWERED</strong></h3>",
        "text_t4yfrwEs6mvg49we": "<p><strong>What does flavored air taste like?</strong></p>",
        "text_KhRanUeXehB4j1b1": "<p><strong>If you’re used to vapor, Lio might feel lighter at first—but it’s designed for a healthier future. Think of Lio as herbal tea compared to the sticky soda of vapor: less intense, more natural, and far better for you.</strong></p>",
        "text_CxUnbmsDXyAFsjWX": "<p>Is Lio safe to use?</p>",
        "text_zCFVphSUSLoMzFrk": "<p><strong>Lio is made with 100% natural ingredients and is completely free from nicotine, smoke, and harmful chemicals, making it a safe and healthier alternative for people trying to quit smoking or vaping.</strong></p>",
        "text_BwUfgMAAhP35Ylxz": "<p>Can I use Lio anywhere?</p>",
        "text_Y0vfhJMXiGMYJ6d0": "<p><strong>Yes! Lio produces no smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals, so it can be used in most places where smoking or vaping are not allowed. Its discreet and clean design makes it a convenient, portable option to carry and use anywhere, whether you’re at home, work, or on the go.</strong></p>",
        "text_bX3NLDtvbJNvFi7t": "<p>How does Lio work?</p>",
        "text_x7AXDG64544BB1t5": "<p><strong>Lio works by replacing the hand-to-mouth fixation with naturally infused air, offering calming, refreshing flavors without nicotine, smoke, or chemicals. This action helps reduce the psychological need for smoking or vaping while keeping you engaged with familiar habits.</strong></p>",
        "text_Cj4Sw7MlJs94OK7X": "<p>How long do the Lio Cores last?</p>",
        "text_IX5T22BYXkohmDn1": "<p><strong>Each Lio Core lasts 2-4 days, depending on your usage. Heavy users may need to replace the cores more frequently, but they are designed to provide lasting flavor and a satisfying experience.</strong></p>",
        "text_6InwN3W7HOwvYALX": "<p>How often can I use Lio?</p>",
        "text_UESkgNWWrPdrXTja": "<p><strong>Use Lio as often as you like. If you experience any discomfort, please discontinue use and consult your physician.</strong></p>",
        "text_nFK3WmqFDeRYWapn": "<p>What are cores made of?</p>",
        "text_4ifVBop8Adj0NJOG": "<p>Each Core fiber is medical grade polyester, infused in the fiber is our unique plant blend of pure essential oils from amazing farms we've partnered with around the world.</p>",
        "text_PCgpdqU0YP2jLtk7": "<p>Shipping & Refunds</p>",
        "text_zZCmOJrgbKuploJR": "<p><strong>Worldwide shipping - For Free</strong></p><p>We ship worldwide from the Netherlands with free shipping on all orders. Delivery takes 2-3 days within Europe, 4-8 days outside Europe, and next-day delivery in the Middle East (from Dubai).</p><p></p><p><strong>The Money Back Guarantee</strong></p><p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_QQ0AnVNNZp4Wwn0M": "<h3>All delicious</h3>",
        "text_4gRsJ0Xh3ilXUoDt": "<h3>FLAVOURs</h3>",
        "text_BhR75r9ftyPSWVIQ": "<h3>you need</h3>",
        "text_QmzboSl3hCsltYIT": "<h3>ALL DELICIOUS</h3>",
        "text_dBnJ2EriHiVnZR5H": "<h3>FLAVOURs</h3>",
        "text_jZG9EHMWSskI0HIL": "<h3>you need</h3>",
        "text_pAaBO04MvGzms13A": "<h3>Reliefs cravings</h3>",
        "text_YuK9g3guHunNKzZm": "<h3>Special blends for </h3><h3>relieving cravings </h3>",
        "text_o0uz3ZZVL3pFz0mj": "<h3>3 Cores Per Bag</h3>",
        "text_qf2sPbc2y1hnnUbx": "<h3>One Core lasts</h3><h3>3/4 days.</h3>",
        "text_2xDB5DJp730eturM": "<h3>No Nicotine</h3>",
        "text_6NvCLZvnJGpJnzdl": "<h3>A true alternative,</h3><h3>break free for real.</h3>",
        "text_sPsxaYc7f0Ph3Ei7": "<h3>100% Safe</h3>",
        "text_T2KdEi7tXPCKMpTB": "<h3>Proven safe </h3><h3>by scientists</h3>",
        "url_cBcM8Sm1kIXk12tX": "#iQOzOcy59IDcgCklf",
        "text_8smzkLjWoNOJ0D0k": "<p>Order Journey Pack</p>",
        "text_Sx0ZdazVnV4bI1tT": "<p>30-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "text_UwbzdyKIczAD6DIA": "<h3>what our customers say</h3>",
        "text_GNTA7bTHwz7kCzGx": "<p>Discover the incredible </p><p>success stories our customers.</p>",
        "text_Xb095DOPDLuLYwp7": "<p><em>Absolute game-changer!</em></p>",
        "text_5zgvQ9AE6BZ1QVwu": "<p>3 months nicotine-free thanks to Lio! The customer service was exceptional. I'm grateful for this product on my journey to quit smoking💪</p>",
        "text_7vXOCJjzw6wuY14H": "<p>Sofie (5 days ago)</p>",
        "text_brEnby3hMgz3Bxnt": "<p><em>Simple and effective!</em></p>",
        "text_jdZ4HSgT3FYYCagb": "<p>After a week of using Lio, I already feel the difference. No smoke, no nicotine—just something to keep my hands busy guilt-free. A true lifesaver!</p>",
        "text_9y8EHLgd51c0gD6A": "<p>Zakaria Ernst (23 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_wJuTe3QCIlqoMqx8": "<p>Lio Saved My Life</p>",
        "text_7ELXKwz9tbaK7yzF": "<p><em>I was smoking almost 60 cigarettes per day. I tried lots of expensive ways to quit smoking but unfortunately without results. I decided to try Lio and in 2 weeks I'm only using this. Without anxiety crisis.</em></p>",
        "text_2fOHtPpBNqiq7HUh": "<p>Pedro (11 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_hQJsP4oUCe3PFr3E": "<p>A Simple Way to Quit</p>",
        "text_PB34kEQ2vqjlqCY9": "<p><em>I've been using this product for almost a week, and what an insanely good idea it was. While it is very difficult to stop vaping, this product did that with the most simplicity. Bless you all.</em></p>",
        "text_2ewbNZsHSQ4Q7jOp": "<p>Amr (1 Oct 2024)</p>",
        "text_Rs5GURbVTOPS3Q29": "<p><em>Amazing product</em></p>",
        "text_xjd2z3GBteavN3kO": "<p>74 days smoke-free thanks to Lio! . This is a fantastic tool for anyone quitting smoking. Highly recommended!</p>",
        "text_Fg3M3ZObkvu0Fhxm": "<p>Noëlle Huizer (17 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_cXYxB5uSa4ZxDgYe": "<p><em>I quit after 35 years</em></p>",
        "text_rHwZw1gyN9QBLq5Z": "<p>After seeing my colleague with his Lio, I took the plunge. I had been a smoker for 35 years and quitting was hell. With Lio it goes without saying, although I don't leave my house without it.</p>",
        "text_wovxgILEnsFthPOz": "<p>Koen (2 May 2024)</p>",
        "text_E7nncSxHz8m80TAv": "<p><em>\"Helps me stay off cigs!\"</em></p>",
        "text_4MSQVpL1iLmIeiCk": "<p>Lio has been an excellent replacement to curb my cravings. Lost my device, but they quickly sent a replacement—great product and service!</p>",
        "text_ljLMsKf9fvvQB4Pi": "<p>Josje (4 days ago)</p>",
        "text_34K6im3BvB7OywDk": "<p><em>I finally quit</em></p>",
        "text_g3VQLay9Ffh9h43b": "<p><em>Loving my Lio! So happy to finally be off the vape after years and years. Would definitely recommend.</em></p>",
        "text_pT4f9IPZBqBGxRBL": "<p>Bridgett (10 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_VO97pfF4cXZtbeod": "<p>Great, fast service!</p>",
        "text_RO9VGBXlyzbox1FX": "<p>Received quick and friendly help when my package arrived damaged. The issue was resolved smoothly—excellent customer support!</p>",
        "text_Bm5dBHOjeIVan5G7": "<p>Stefan Blokzijl (1 day ago)</p>",
        "text_4fVg0mcGzX46XXSo": "<h3><strong>YOU ASKED</strong></h3>",
        "text_29HvUl2tI0Ilvq4v": "<h3><strong>WE ANSWERED</strong></h3>",
        "text_lKotoxmGabAEXiM2": "<p><strong>What does flavored air taste like?</strong></p>",
        "text_1vk70YiHxY3Aoy2E": "<p><strong>If you’re used to vapor, Lio might feel lighter at first—but it’s designed for a healthier future. Think of Lio as herbal tea compared to the sticky soda of vapor: less intense, more natural, and far better for you.</strong></p>",
        "text_2Xz6h3XdZJtoKMa6": "<p>How long do the Lio Cores last?</p>",
        "text_Xijy5AEnSWQBWKnY": "<p><strong>Each Lio Core lasts 2-4 days, depending on your usage. Heavy users may need to replace the cores more frequently, but they are designed to provide lasting flavor and a satisfying experience.</strong></p>",
        "text_6f9cY6xyGU0s0U3y": "<p>What are cores made of?</p>",
        "text_7YrLzCf0y0h5a5MM": "<p>Each Core fiber is medical grade polyester, infused in the fiber is our unique plant blend of pure essential oils from amazing farms we've partnered with around the world.</p>",
        "text_WUpLzeelgMp9w6aj": "<p>How does Lio work?</p>",
        "text_jJ6UZS8VSgQopCg8": "<p><strong>Lio works by replacing the hand-to-mouth fixation with naturally infused air, offering calming, refreshing flavors without nicotine, smoke, or chemicals. This action helps reduce the psychological need for smoking or vaping while keeping you engaged with familiar habits.</strong></p>",
        "text_z3z0KCRCbpbaFj1H": "<p>How often can I use Lio?</p>",
        "text_Jb9bejlHAvIA8LHp": "<p><strong>Use Lio as often as you like. If you experience any discomfort, please discontinue use and consult your physician.</strong></p>",
        "text_3nCOOVDpTdR9azod": "<p>Can I use Lio anywhere?</p>",
        "text_weyOilABAn5MMPpA": "<p><strong>Yes! Lio produces no smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals, so it can be used in most places where smoking or vaping are not allowed. Its discreet and clean design makes it a convenient, portable option to carry and use anywhere, whether you’re at home, work, or on the go.</strong></p>",
        "text_6bQAz7SgRgzt5Aqd": "<p>Shipping & Refunds</p>",
        "text_40bdTuDHkDjZYNKZ": "<p><strong>Worldwide shipping - For Free</strong></p><p>We ship worldwide from the Netherlands with free shipping on all orders. Delivery takes 2-3 days within Europe, 4-8 days outside Europe, and next-day delivery in the Middle East (from Dubai).</p><p></p><p><strong>The Money Back Guarantee</strong></p><p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_5F8JfBcVHvuhBjN6": "<p>Is Lio safe to use?</p>",
        "text_VUlOdckdKgauM61g": "<p><strong>Lio is made with 100% natural ingredients and is completely free from nicotine, smoke, and harmful chemicals, making it a safe and healthier alternative for people trying to quit smoking or vaping.</strong></p>",
        "text_zinyU4KHy5tRGlQv": "<h3><strong>We're proud of</strong></h3>",
        "text_9L5Hk5Z557jRCrZL": "<h3><strong>OUR REVIEWS</strong></h3>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
